metaform-vsa carries code adapted from the hypervector crate.

  Source:   https://github.com/rishikanthc/hypervector
  Version:  0.1.3
  License:  MIT OR Apache-2.0
  Copyright (c) 2025 Rishikanth Chandrasekaran

Files adapted:

  crates/vsa/src/lib.rs   the VSA trait, the generic Hypervector type, the global RNG and the
                          TieBreaker enumeration
  crates/vsa/src/mbat.rs  the bipolar MBAT implementation

Changes made in this repository:

  - the once_cell dependency was replaced by std::sync::OnceLock;
  - serde derives were removed, leaving rand as the only dependency;
  - encoder, ssp and fhrr were not carried over;
  - negate was added to the VSA trait, and `retrieval` is new code that belongs to this repository.

The upstream license text is the same MIT and Apache-2.0 pair that this repository already ships as
LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE, so no additional copy is kept here.
